5333	    // com.docker.compose.project.config_files label (in the source's own `-f`
5334	    // order). Bringing up only ONE guessed file starts base/infra services but
5335	    // NOT a tier defined in a prod override (docker-compose.prod.yml), so the
5336	    // domain never serves. We replay the exact list instead. Keep the first
5337	    // non-empty list per working-dir.
